Better Than Mending for Sunrise (version 0.5.0)

A port of Better Than Mending by legobmw99.
Original source: https://github.com/legobmw99/BetterThanMending
Original licence: GPL-3.0-only

Ported to Minecraft 26.3 by lavoide, and to Sunrise by arismoko: the rules are re-implemented in
Rust on Sunrise's mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same
licence as the original (GPL-3.0-only); the licence text is in LICENSE.
